# md opens the due date prompt with the current date selected; typing a new date replaces it and Enter saves it.
file <<END
- Renew passport @due(2026-12-01)
END
see Renew passport
keys md
see Due date
see Tue 1 Dec 2026
type 2026-11-15
see Sun 15 Nov 2026
keys <Enter>
hide Due date
quit
saved <<END
- Renew passport @due(2026-11-15)
END
